    "body": "Consider the Boolean operator # with the following \nproperties: \n x # 0 = x, x #1 = 𝑥̅, x # x = 0  and   x # 𝑥̅ = 1 \n Then x # y is equivalent to \n (a) x𝑦̅ + 𝑥̅y (b) x𝑦̅ + 𝑥̅𝑦̅ \n (c) 𝑥̅y + xy (d) xy + 𝑥̅𝑦̅",
