    "body": "Consider a non-negative counting semaphore S. The \noperation P(S) decrements S, and V(S) increments S. \nDuring an execution, 20 P(S) operations and 12 V(S) \noperations are issued in some order. The largest \ninitial value of S for which at least one P(S) \noperation will remain blocked is ____",
