    "day": 71,
    "answerKey": "a",
    "solution": "When Interrupt occur, after completion of current \nInstruction.  \n Interrupt will be serviced, It push the program \ncurrent [PC] value into stack & control transfer to \nISR. \n Q: Process finish the current instruction \nexecution  \n P: PUSH the PC value into stack \n T: Interrupt → PC \n R: Service the Interrupt \n S: Pop the PC value",
    "id": "pyq_71_754"
