    "day": 83,
    "answerKey": "a",
    "solution": "Initialize the address register → 1 cycle \n Initialize the count to 500 → 1 cycle \n LOOP7: Load a byte from device → 2 cycle \n Store in memory at address given by address register \n→ 2 cycle \n Increment the address register → 1 cycle \n Decrement the court → 1 cycle \n If count! = 0 go to LOOP → 1 cycle \n In each one interation of loop takes \n = 2+ 2 + 1 + 1 +1 = 7 Cycle \n Loop execute = 500 times (Iteration) \n Total time taken in 500 interatin = 500 × 7 = 3500 \nCycle \n Total time in ISR = 3500 + 2 = 3502 Cycle \n 500 Byte transfer using DMA \n In DMA transfer Tim = 20 + 2 × 500 = 1020 Cycle \n Speed up = \n3502 3.41020 =",
    "id": "pyq_83_848"
