    "type": "NAT",
    "exam": "GATE-2015 : 2M",
    "body": "Consider a typical disk that rotates at 15000 rotations \nper minute (RPM) and has a transfer rate of 50 × 10 6 \nbytes/sec. If the average seek time of the disk is twice \nthe average rotational delay and the controller’s \ntransfer time is 10 times the disk transfer time, the \naverage time (in milliseconds) to read or write a 512 -\nbyte sector of the disk is _____.",
