    "type": "MSQ",
    "exam": "GATE-2021 : 2M",
    "body": "Suppose the following functional dependencies hold \non a relation U with attributes P, Q, R, S, and T: \n •   P → QR \n •   RS → T \n Which of the following functional dependencies can \nbe inferred from the above functional dependencies? \n (a) PS → T (b) R → T \n (c) P → R (d) PS → Q",
