    "answerKey": "c",
    "solution": "X → Y is trivial functional dependency if and only if, \nX  Y  \n PS → S  \n PS   S; So, it is a trivial FD. \n Option b is a semi-trivial FD. Hence, it is incorrect. \n \n\n \nDatabase Management System",
