    "body": "A relation r(A, B) in a relational database has 1200 \ntuples. The attribute A has integer values ranging \nfrom 6 to 20 , and the attribute B has integer values \nranging from 1 to 20 . Assume that the attributes A \nand B are independently distributed. \n The estimated number of tuples in the output of σ (A>10)  \nV (B = 18) (r) is",
