    "exam": "GATE-2015 : 2M",
    "body": "Consider a B+ tree in which the search key is 12 bytes \nlong, block size is 1024 bytes, record pointer is 10 \nbytes long and block pointer is 8 bytes long. The \nmaximum number of keys that can be accommodated \nin each non-leaf node of the tree is _____________",
