    "answerKey": "50 to 50",
    "solution": "Key = 12 Byte, Block Pointer(BP) = 8 Byte, Block \nsize = 1024Byte, Record Pointer (RP) = 10 Byte. \n B+ tree: Non leaf Node: \n ORDER(P): P × BP + (P –1) key  Block size  \n P × 8 + (P – 1) 12  1024 \n 8P + 12 P – 12  1024 \n 20P  1036 Maximum Block Pointer \n \n 1036P = 51.8 P = 5120\n ==  \n Maximum Number of keys = P – 1 \n                                              = 51 – 1 \n                                                = 50. \n \n\n \nFile Organization and Indexing",
